:: AGAEA-EAPov {"position":"425,100","size":"100,100"}
“God, I cannot focus!”
-
You drop your pencil.
-
You:
(Maybe I need a change of scenery.)
-
You:
(Wasn’t a new park opened recently?)
-
You take out your phone to check. There is a new park, and its really close by. You put all of your study materials and some books into a bag, and walk to the park. You find a nice bench that has the perfect amount of sun and shade and sit down.
-
(text-style:"underline")[What should you do?]

[[Read ->Read1]] - [[Write->Write1]] -  [[Listen to Music->Music1]]


:: AGAEA-LWPOV {"position":"375,100","size":"100,100"}
Husband:
“Don’t forget it’s your turn to take the kids to the park this week.”
-
Your husband says as he makes a cup of coffee.
-
You:
“Is that this week already?”
-
Your husband nods and leaves the kitchen.
-
You:
(We haven’t been to the park in a while.)
-
(text-style:"underline")[We could…]

[[Bike ->Bike1]] - [[Walk ->Walk1]] -  [[Drive->Drive1]]



:: AGALW-EAPov {"position":"225,100","size":"100,100"}
You are lying in your bed, staring at the ceiling. 
-
You:
(It’s a nice day outside. I should see if any of my friends want to do anything. )
-
You text your friends, Kim and Beverly, and agree to have a picnic at the new lawn. Your mom drives you to the lawn with some snacks and a blanket. Your friends finally arrive, and everyone walks over.
-
Kim:
“God, what’s that smell?” 
-
You:
(She is right, it smells really bad.) 
-
You:
“Do you guys want to just go?”
-
Beverly:
“Well, it was your idea, do you want to?”
-
(text-style:"underline")[Do you leave or stay?]

[[Leave ->Leave]] - [[Stay->Stay]]



:: AGALW-LWPOV {"position":"200,100","size":"100,100"}
''Liam'':
“Mommmm can we pleaseeee go outside? I’m sooo booooored!” 
-
You turn around to see your two children, Sam and Liam, behind you.
-
''Sam'':
“I promise we’ll be good!”
-
''You'':
//(Didn’t they just upgrade that preserve nearby?)//
-
''You'':
“Okay, but Mommy gets to decide where we go.”
-
You round them up into the car and go to the preserve. Once you arrive, there are 3 paths. The left path appears to lead to a cove, the middle path appears to be an easy path, and the right path looks more difficult.
-
''Sam:''
“ Let’s go to the left.”
-
''Liam:''
“But, I want to go on the right path!” 
-
(text-style:"underline")[What path do you choose?]

[[Left Path->Left Path]] - [[Middle Path->Middle Path]] - [[Right Path->Right Path]]


:: Bike1 {"position":"400,175","size":"100,100"}
You:
(We haven’t used our bikes in a while.)
- 
You:
“Liam, Sam, go find your helmets!”
-
You hear them rummaging through stuff upstairs and tripping over themselves as they race down the stairs. 
-
Liam and Sam:
“Ready!”
-
You grab all the bikes from the garage and have a nice bike ride to the park as the shade from the Oak trees keeps you cool. Once you reach the park, the kids are eager to run around and play together. You sit down on a bench and watch them.
-



:: Candles {"position":"775,250","size":"100,100"}
You:
(She is always eyeing these candles.)
-
You:
“Okay, I’m ready. Goodbye, my little ones, we love you! Don’t give the babysitter a hard time.”
-
You give them a kiss on the cheek and leave. The walk through the greenery to your friend Lisa’s house is very short. You arrive and knock on the door. 
-
Lisa:
“Diana! You finally made it!” 
-
The two of you hug. You offer the candles 
-
Lisa:
“Are these? I’ve always wanted these candles! Thank you!”
-
She takes the candles. 
-
You:
“It was no problem, and you remember my husband.” 
-
Lisa:
“Of course!”
-
The two greet each other. 
-
You:
(I’m glad I told her that the city was going to build more homes on the land that they bought.)
-
You:
“I’m so happy that you were able to find a place over here.” 
-
Lisa:
“Me too! Especially with all those protests happening in East Austin. I’m glad we left when we did.”
-
You:
“It’s crazy. Those protests are getting really intense. I don’t understand why there’s so much unrest. Austin is so green!”
-
Lisa:
“To be fair, East Austin does get the short end of the stick when it comes to green spaces.”
-



:: Drive1 {"position":"425,250","size":"100,100"}
